  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nOption 1) 31 – 5 – 160\n\n__(31 × 5)__ + 5 = 160\n\n__155 + 5__ = 160\n\n160 = 160 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 2) 27 – 9 – 243\n\n__(27 × 9)__ + 5 = 243\n\n__243 + 5__ = 243\n\n248 ≠ 243 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) 21 – 4 – 89\n\n__(21 × 4)__ + 5 = 89\n\n__84 + 5__ = 89\n\n89 = 89 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4) 13 – 8 – 109\n\n__(13 × 8)__ + 5 = 109\n\n__104 + 5__ = 109\n\n109 = 109 (LHS = RHS)\n\nThus, out of all the options '27 – 9 – 243' is the odd one out.\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
